4. Apothic Spawners 1.21 code

Initial health, burning, and echoing spawner behavior is adapted for
Minecraft 1.20.1. No Apothic Spawners artwork is included by this port.
The four preset rune symbol overlays are original artwork. Their item
models reference apotheosis:items/gem_fused_slate from the installed
Apotheosis dependency as a shared background; that background texture is
not copied into this distribution.

Source: https://github.com/Shadows-of-Fire/Apothic-Spawners/tree/fa52d69e86817a377116b669383703f8b6838f8a
