5. Apotheosis sigils and Apothic Enchanting Ender Leads (1.21)

Sigil of Supremacy and Sigil of Malice behavior is adapted from Apotheosis.
The normal and occult Ender Lead tiers are adapted from Apothic Enchanting, retaining
the existing Apotheosis 1.20.1 normal Ender Lead item ID and storage format.
The two new sigil symbol overlays are original artwork. Their item models
use the same runtime gem_fused_slate background reference described above.
The occult Ender Lead icon is
a recolor of the Apotheosis 7.4.8 Ender Lead texture, not original artwork.
Its source is assets/apotheosis/textures/items/ender_lead.png in Apotheosis
1.20. Retain the 1.20 upstream notice in section 2; this attribution does not
assert approval by a distribution platform. No upstream sound files are
included by these ports.

Apotheosis source: https://github.com/Shadows-of-Fire/Apotheosis/tree/7dd7cec26830074f1745529eb8f1f533092733d0
Apotheosis license: https://github.com/Shadows-of-Fire/Apotheosis/blob/7dd7cec26830074f1745529eb8f1f533092733d0/LICENSE
